294
00:32:17,950 --> 00:32:23,410
Now, of course, this set
here-- so A here is bounded.

295
00:32:23,410 --> 00:32:24,270
It's not empty.

296
00:32:24,270 --> 00:32:25,960
We'll say first, it's not empty.

297
00:32:29,370 --> 00:32:38,090
It's not empty since 1 here
